; The Hungarian PC keyboard by position: each key presses the TVC key with the same legend.
; The TVC keys a PC lacks (@ ; < \ [ ] * ^) sit on F1-F8; the cursor keys are joystick 1, fire on RCTRL; the
; keypad is joystick 2. Lines: HOST KEY = TVC KEY [+shift|-shift], or "none" to free a host key. Host key names: A-Z, 0-9,
; GRAVE MINUS EQUALS LEFTBRACKET RIGHTBRACKET BACKSLASH NONUSHASH SEMICOLON APOSTROPHE COMMA PERIOD SLASH NONUSBACKSLASH,
; SPACE RETURN ESCAPE BACKSPACE TAB CAPSLOCK F1-F8 INSERT DELETE HOME END PAGEUP PAGEDOWN UP DOWN LEFT RIGHT, KP_0-KP_9 and
; the other KP_ keys, LSHIFT RSHIFT LCTRL RCTRL LALT RALT LGUI RGUI MENU. TVC keys: their legend, SEMICOLON for ";", or
; RETURN DEL ESC INS SHIFT LOCK CTRL ALT SPACE, UP DOWN LEFT RIGHT FIRE ACCEL (joystick 1), JOY2_UP ... JOY4_FIRE.
